{"version":2,"slug":"5-reasons-why-i-started-my-vlog-in-slow-english","videoId":"WEMuWTJa1qQ","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/WEMuWTJa1qQ","lang":"en","title":"5 reasons why I started my vlog (in slow English!)","category":"Vlog","channel":"English listening practice","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":29,"text":"Hi everyone."},{"start":31,"text":"Welcome to a new episode of Boe's Slow"},{"start":36,"text":"English."},{"start":38,"text":"We are on our last day here in Mo'orea,"},{"start":43,"text":"which is an island near Tahiti in French"},{"start":48,"text":"Polynesia."},{"start":50,"text":"And I thought I'd take the time to"},{"start":54,"text":"introduce"},{"start":55,"text":"myself and"},{"start":58,"text":"explain why I started my YouTube"},{"start":61,"text":"channel."},{"start":65,"text":"I am a language learner myself."},{"start":70,"text":"I am currently learning French and"},{"start":74,"text":"Korean on a daily basis."},{"start":78,"text":"I watch YouTube channels"},{"start":81,"text":"and my preferred"},{"start":84,"text":"videos are"},{"start":86,"text":"slow speaking"},{"start":88,"text":"vlog style videos."},{"start":91,"text":"I find them to be entertaining"},{"start":95,"text":"and when"},{"start":97,"text":"they speak slowly, I can"},{"start":100,"text":"catch up my thoughts"},{"start":103,"text":"in my brain"},{"start":105,"text":"to"},{"start":106,"text":"the words"},{"start":108,"text":"of what they're saying."},{"start":110,"text":"So, one day"},{"start":112,"text":"I was curious."},{"start":114,"text":"I was searching for"},{"start":117,"text":"English slow speaking vlog and I did not"},{"start":122,"text":"find"},{"start":123,"text":"many options."},{"start":126,"text":"So, the next day I decided to start a"},{"start":129,"text":"YouTube channel."},{"start":131,"text":"I thought, why not?"},{"start":137,"text":"I enjoy learning new things. I've never"},{"start":142,"text":"edited"},{"start":143,"text":"videos before."},{"start":146,"text":"I think it's still a bit awkward for me"},{"start":149,"text":"to"},{"start":151,"text":"talk about my life and"},{"start":154,"text":"point out the things that are around me."},{"start":158,"text":"Also, it's a little bit awkward to"},{"start":161,"text":"say everything slowly"},{"start":164,"text":"while looking into the camera."},{"start":168,"text":"So, all of this combines, I find to be"},{"start":172,"text":"challenging"},{"start":173,"text":"in addition to spending hours to edit"},{"start":177,"text":"each video."},{"start":179,"text":"But, I find a lot of joy in challenges"},{"start":183,"text":"and excelling in skills that I teach"},{"start":188,"text":"myself."},{"start":192,"text":"I like to meet new people"},{"start":195,"text":"and I'm"},{"start":197,"text":"very new to this."},{"start":201,"text":"And I'm already starting to get random"},{"start":205,"text":"comments from"},{"start":207,"text":"subscribers around the world."},{"start":210,"text":"And I think it's incredible to be able"},{"start":214,"text":"to interact"},{"start":216,"text":"and"},{"start":217,"text":"in a way touch someone from so"},{"start":221,"text":"far away. I don't even know where"},{"start":225,"text":"my subscribers live and sometimes"},{"start":228,"text":"YouTube"},{"start":230,"text":"does not show who my subscribers are"},{"start":233,"text":"because some people choose to have their"},{"start":239,"text":"profiles private."},{"start":242,"text":"So, I just want to say thank you to"},{"start":245,"text":"anyone and everyone who has liked my"},{"start":250,"text":"content, subscribed to my channel, and"},{"start":254,"text":"commented. I genuinely"},{"start":258,"text":"want to get to know you,"},{"start":260,"text":"and"},{"start":262,"text":"feel free to send me any feedback, or if"},{"start":267,"text":"you have any suggestions on"},{"start":270,"text":"additional vlog ideas, I would be more"},{"start":274,"text":"than happy to entertain that and create"},{"start":279,"text":"a video just for you."},{"start":284,"text":"I like teaching people"},{"start":288,"text":"any type of expertise"},{"start":292,"text":"that I have."},{"start":293,"text":"It takes"},{"start":295,"text":"a lot of your own research,"},{"start":299,"text":"hard work,"},{"start":301,"text":"effort,"},{"start":302,"text":"time, and patience"},{"start":305,"text":"to learn anything."},{"start":311,"text":"I am an immigrant"},{"start":314,"text":"from Korea."},{"start":316,"text":"My"},{"start":317,"text":"family and I moved to Baltimore,"},{"start":322,"text":"Maryland, when I was one."},{"start":325,"text":"So, I grew up speaking"},{"start":329,"text":"fluent Korean."},{"start":332,"text":"However, once I entered"},{"start":335,"text":"elementary school and preschool,"},{"start":339,"text":"I was enrolled in ESL,"},{"start":343,"text":"which I believe stands for"},{"start":347,"text":"English speakers"},{"start":349,"text":"of other languages."},{"start":352,"text":"Feel free to correct me if I'm wrong."},{"start":356,"text":"Even though I graduated ESL in first"},{"start":359,"text":"grade, it took me some time to"},{"start":365,"text":"build my confidence in"},{"start":368,"text":"my pronunciation,"},{"start":370,"text":"my speaking skills, my listening"},{"start":374,"text":"comprehension,"},{"start":376,"text":"reading comprehension,"},{"start":377,"text":"writing comprehension,"},{"start":380,"text":"and"},{"start":381,"text":"that's why I find"},{"start":386,"text":"some joy out of creating these videos"},{"start":390,"text":"because it's one additional method in"},{"start":394,"text":"helping me to learn"},{"start":396,"text":"English. Those are my top five reasons"},{"start":401,"text":"as to why I created my channel."},{"start":405,"text":"I'm sure that I can come up with"},{"start":409,"text":"a million and one more reasons why I"},{"start":414,"text":"started my channel."},{"start":417,"text":"I am so grateful"},{"start":419,"text":"for you and taking the time to watch my"},{"start":423,"text":"video,"},{"start":425,"text":"and I apologize in advance"},{"start":428,"text":"for"},{"start":430,"text":"any awkwardness"},{"start":432,"text":"that I show in my videos because it's"},{"start":435,"text":"not quite 100%"},{"start":438,"text":"natural for me"},{"start":440,"text":"to talk into the camera."},{"start":444,"text":"But, I'm trying,"},{"start":446,"text":"and thank you again."},{"start":448,"text":"I hope you enjoyed this video"},{"start":452,"text":"the last few hours here in the French"},{"start":456,"text":"Polynesia."},{"start":477,"text":"Woo!"}]}